tutorial_text = "Breach the royal palace and reclaim your vengeance:
- March through the grand avenues, gardens, and inner bastions.
- Claim ancient forbidden relics from royal crypts.
- Confront King Alden in the Banquet Hall where he murdered your Vanguard."
